# Local, operator-supplied secrets for the compose examples under docker/examples. Docker Compose reads
# a ".env" file next to a compose file for its "${...}" interpolation; ignoring the path keeps the
# passwords the examples require out of the repository (see DOCKER.adoc, "Credentials of the compose
# example").
docker/examples/*/.env
